ChargeSend is an unofficial community modification of OpenAI Codex CLI.
It adds terminal capability negotiation, a hold/release charge controller,
composer rendering, prompt-local effort handling, tests, and build tooling.
Modified upstream source files carry a ChargeSend modification notice.
